{"about_the_game":"NOTE: Although this game is fully released, please think of it as an Early Access Game. Only buy this game if you are okay with rough edges and bugs. I'll keep working on making improvements. Expect significant changes to game-play and features<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Gameplay:</h2>Those Left Behind is an action-horror game set in a city and its surrounding area shortly after a mysterious, global event transforms most people into flesh-eating monsters.<br><br>Take control of survivors who must venture out of their safe house every night in search of supplies. As the world becomes more and more dangerous, race against the clock to find a truly safe place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/2dab43e162a3aceb7cb38a25732f978c.avif?t=1716192787\" width=384 height=256 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW LOCATIONS</h2>The world has violently torn itself apart, and the blood is still wet. Make your way through dangerous and carnage-filled environments to unlock new locations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/ad78391916729f7de3865d639adef08a.poster.avif?t=1716192787\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/ad78391916729f7de3865d639adef08a.webm?t=1716192787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/ad78391916729f7de3865d639adef08a.mp4?t=1716192787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK FOR SUPPLIES... AND OTHER SURVIVORS</h2>Scavenge outside not only for essential supplies such as food and water, but also for materials to build up your home. Find other survivors to join your community and improve your chance of survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/e089308d7e03f1a5cc1f03975855a161.avif?t=1716192787\" width=400 height=258 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT TO SURVIVE</h2>Vicious monsters want to tear you apart from limb-to-limb. Fight back with an assortment of melee weapons and guns, including axes, machetes, shotguns and rifles. Upgrade your community\u2019s combat and scavenging abilities with points earned from felling your foes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/6f5c8290ca759fac684b195f56c8b60d.poster.avif?t=1716192787\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/6f5c8290ca759fac684b195f56c8b60d.webm?t=1716192787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/6f5c8290ca759fac684b195f56c8b60d.mp4?t=1716192787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Some Game Features to Note:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Survivors have (light) backstories revealed by their &quot;Journal Entries&quot;<br></li><li>Survivors have statuses (Injury, Fatigue, Hunger, Sickness)<br></li><li>Survivors have traits (e.g. speed)<br></li><li>Survivors can equip body armor, shoes, and weapons<br></li><li>A trading system</li></ul>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2101070?t=1716192787","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2101070?t=1716192787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1716192787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1716192787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game has gore and violence. There is a lot of blood."},"detailed_description":"NOTE: Although this game is fully released, please think of it as an Early Access Game. Only buy this game if you are okay with rough edges and bugs. I'll keep working on making improvements. Expect significant changes to game-play and features<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Gameplay:</h2>Those Left Behind is an action-horror game set in a city and its surrounding area shortly after a mysterious, global event transforms most people into flesh-eating monsters.<br><br>Take control of survivors who must venture out of their safe house every night in search of supplies. As the world becomes more and more dangerous, race against the clock to find a truly safe place.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/2dab43e162a3aceb7cb38a25732f978c.avif?t=1716192787\" width=384 height=256 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW LOCATIONS</h2>The world has violently torn itself apart, and the blood is still wet. Make your way through dangerous and carnage-filled environments to unlock new locations.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/ad78391916729f7de3865d639adef08a.poster.avif?t=1716192787\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/ad78391916729f7de3865d639adef08a.webm?t=1716192787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101070/extras/ad78391916729f7de3865d639adef08a.mp4?t=1716192787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></